%S A401550 1,1,1,2,5,13,49,224,1201,7252,47100,320817,2260571,16340044
%N A401550 Number of inscribable simplicial polyhedra with n nodes.
%C A401550 The terms for n <= 15 were independently verified using a linear program implementing the criterion R* or R for the planar dual polyhedron from the Hodgson, Rivin and Smith article.
%H A401550 Michael B. Dillencourt, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1006/jctb.1996.0008">Polyhedra of Small Order and Their Hamiltonian Properties</a>, Journal of Combinatorial Theory, Series B, Volume 66, Issue 1, 1996, Pages 87-122. (Page 111, Table XIII, column "Not inscr")
%H A401550 Craig D. Hodgson, Igor Rivin, and Warren D. Smith, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/math/9210218">A characterization of convex hyperbolic polyhedra and of convex polyhedra inscribed in the sphere</a>, arXiv:math/9210218 [math.MG], 1 Oct 1992.
%F A401550 a(n) = A000109(n) - A007037(n) for n >= 3.
%Y A401550 Cf. A000109, A007037, A401551.
%K A401550 nonn,more,new
%O A401550 3,4
